    "text": "If&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msup></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></msqrt></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></math> (where,&nbsp;<math><mi>C</mi></math> is the constant of integration) and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>15</mn></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math>, then&nbsp;the value of <math><mn>2</mn><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math> is"
  },
